---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice"
  description="How Scottish Energy Services uses website enquiry details and how to contact us about your personal information."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <p>
        Scottish Energy Services, 272 Bath St, Glasgow G2 4JR, receives the
        information you submit through this website. Contact{" "}
        <a href="mailto:info@scottishenergyservices.co.uk">
          info@scottishenergyservices.co.uk
        </a>{" "}
        with questions about your information.
      </p>
      <h2>Enquiry information</h2>
      <p>
        The form collects contact details, the requested service, property
        information and your message. We use these details to respond to your
        request, discuss the instruction and prepare a quotation. Please avoid
        including sensitive personal information in the message or in documents
        you send.
      </p>
      <h2>Website service providers</h2>
      <p>
        The website uses Vercel for hosting and form processing, Cloudflare
        Turnstile to protect forms against automated submissions, and Resend to
        deliver enquiry emails. These services process information as needed to
        perform those functions.
      </p>
      <h2>Optional measurement</h2>
      <p>
        With your permission, Google Ads is loaded to measure website activity
        and enquiry actions. Contact details and the contents of your enquiry
        are not included in the analytics events implemented on this website.
        You can change your choice using Cookie preferences in the footer.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions and requests</h2>
      <p>
        Contact us to discuss access to, correction of or deletion of your
        personal information. You can also raise a concern with the{" "}
        <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/">
          Information Commissioner’s Office
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <!-- OWNER TODO before launch: confirm controller legal identity, lawful bases, retention periods, international transfer arrangements and complete rights information with business privacy adviser. -->
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
